    {
      "title": "Warning",
      "sectionType": "WARNING",
      "items": [
        {"detail": "Always get your rental contract in writing — never pay a deposit based on a verbal agreement. For deposits over ₩3,000,000, verify at your local district office (구청 — Gucheong) or community center (동사무소 — Dong Samuso) that the landlord actually owns the property (등기부등본 — Deunggibu Deungbon check). This protects you from rental fraud (전세 사기 — Jeonse Sagi)."}
      ]
